Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue 1: Kafka Connection Refused

# Check if Kafka is running
jps | grep Kafka

# Verify Kafka port is listening
netstat -tlnp | grep 9092

# Restart Kafka if needed
cd /opt/kafka
bin/kafka-server-stop.sh
bin/kafka-server-start.sh config/server.properties
Issue 2: Maven Compilation Errors

# Clean and reinstall dependencies
mvn clean install -U

# Check Java version
java -version
mvn -version
Issue 3: JSON Serialization Issues

Ensure all Order class fields have proper getters/setters
Verify Jackson annotations are correct
Check for circular references in object models
Issue 4: Consumer Group Not Processing Messages

# Reset consumer group offset
cd /opt/kafka
bin/kafka-consumer-groups.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --group order-processor-group --reset-offsets --to-earliest --topic order-events --execute
